662: ## Anti-Patterns to Avoid
663: 
664: ### ❌ Don't: Rewrite AGENTS.md Every Session
665: 
666: **Wrong:**
667: ```
668: User: "Write a new AGENTS.md for this session..."
669: ```
670: 
671: **Right:**
672: ```
673: User: "Update AGENTS.md section [X] to add [Y] rule"
674: ```
675: 
676: ### ❌ Don't: Add Timestamps to the Prefix
677: 
678: **Wrong:**
679: ```
680: # Project Context
681: # Last updated: 2026-06-08 14:30
682: # Session ID: abc123
683: ```
684: 
685: **Right:**
686: ```
687: # Project Context
688: # Version: 1.1.0
689: # [No timestamps in prefix]
690: ```
691: 
692: ### ❌ Don't: Change the Prefix Mid-Conversation
693: 
694: **Wrong:**
695: ```
696: Message 1: [Prefix A]
697: Message 2: [Prefix A modified]
698: Message 3: [Prefix A modified again]
699: ```
700: 
701: **Right:**
702: ```
703: Message 1: [Prefix A]
704: Message 2: [Prefix A - same]
705: Message 3: [Prefix A - same]
706: ```
707: 
708: ### ❌ Don't: Be Vague About Goals
709: 
710: **Wrong:**
711: ```
712: "Fix the auth issue"
713: ```
714: 
715: **Right:**
716: ```
717: "Fix the JWT token expiration in auth middleware by adding 
718: 5-minute leeway to clock tolerance. Check auth.ts line 146."
719: ```
720: 
721: ### ❌ Don't: Ask for Multiple Unrelated Tasks
722: 
723: **Wrong:**
724: ```
725: "Implement auth pages, fix the footer, add a new model, 
726: and update the database schema"
727: ```
728: 
729: **Right:**
730: ```
731: "Implement auth pages (Phase 2.1). Files: login, register, 
732: forgot-password, reset-password, verify-email."
733: ```
734: 
735: ### ❌ Don't: Skip the 5-Step Pre-Implementation Checklist
736: 
737: **Wrong:**
738: ```
739: "Implement the new feature"
740: [AI immediately starts coding]
741: ```
742: 
743: **Right:**
744: ```
745: "Goal: Implement forgot-password page
746: 
747: 1. Read figma-make/pages/ForgotPasswordPage.tsx
748: 2. Read apps/frontend/src/components/ui/card.tsx
749: 3. Identify risks: Must use Link not onNavigate
750: 4. Approach: Copy figma-make structure, adapt to Next.js
751: 5. THEN write code"
752: ```
