487: 
488: ## 🔐 Role-Based Access
489: 
490: ### Roles
491: 
492: - **Researcher** - Basic access
493: - **Pro Researcher** - + Citation Graph, Research Map, Usage Reports
494: - **Team Lead** - + Team Management, Workspace Analytics
495: - **Admin** - Full access including Admin panel
496: 
497: ### Role Persistence
498: 
499: The `RoleContext` ensures role persists when navigating between pages:
500: 
501: - Login as admin → navigate to `/papers` → still shows admin layout
502: - Role only changes when explicitly visiting `/dashboard/admin`, `/dashboard/researcher`, etc.
503: 
