506: ## 🎨 Design System
507: 
508: - **Framework**: React + TypeScript
509: - **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
510: - **Components**: ShadCN UI (customized)
511: - **Animations**: Framer Motion
512: - **Icons**: Lucide React
513: - **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod
514: 
