516: 
517: ## 📱 Navigation
518: 
519: ### Sidebar Navigation
520: 
521: All authenticated pages use `DashboardLayout` with `AppSidebar`:
522: 
523: - Role-based menu items
524: - Collapsible sections
525: - Active state highlighting
526: - Quick actions
527: 
528: ### Navigation Handler
529: 
530: ```tsx
531: // All pages accept onNavigate prop
532: interface PageProps {
533:   onNavigate: (path: string) => void;
534: }
535: 
536: // Usage in any page
537: <Button onClick={() => onNavigate("/papers")}>Go to Papers</Button>;
538: ```
