210: - ✅ **Paper Upload**: Multi-file drag-and-drop with S3 storage
211: - ✅ **Metadata Extraction**: AI-powered title, author, abstract extraction
212: - ✅ **Advanced Search**: Full-text search with comprehensive filters
213: - ✅ **PDF Preview**: Secure iframe-based PDF viewer
214: 
215: ### Admin & System Monitoring
216: 
217: - ✅ **Real-Time System Metrics**: Live CPU, memory, storage, database monitoring with 10s auto-refresh
218: - ✅ **Accurate CPU Tracking**: Intelligent calculation using Node.js os module (idle/total times)
219: - ✅ **Smart Storage Analytics**: Dynamic estimation (10x usage, min 100GB) for realistic percentages
220: - ✅ **Health Dashboard**: Auto-classified status cards (healthy/degraded/unhealthy/warning/critical)
221: - ✅ **Performance Visualization**: Auto-colored bars (green→blue→yellow→red based on values)
222: - ✅ **System Information**: Real-time platform, versions, memory, uptime display
223: 
224: ### User Experience
225: 
226: - ✅ **Dashboard**: Quick access and navigation with role-based routing
227: - ✅ **Responsive UI**: Mobile-first design with modern components
228: - ✅ **Lazy Loading**: Code splitting with React.lazy and Suspense boundaries
