 236: - **Primary Actor**: Authenticated User
 237: - **Trigger**: User clicks verification link from email
 238: - **Inputs**: `token`
 239: - **Preconditions**: Verification token exists and not expired (policy-defined)
 240: - **Postconditions (Success)**: `User.emailVerified` set; `emailVerificationToken` cleared
 241: - **Main Flow**:
 242:   1. API validates token.
 243:   2. API updates user record.
 244:   3. Web App shows verified state.
 245: - **Related Systems**: Email Service
 246: - **Related API**: `/api/auth` (verify-email)
