 252: - **Trigger**: User submits “Forgot password” form
 253: - **Inputs**: `email`
 254: - **Preconditions**: User account exists (or return generic success to prevent enumeration)
 255: - **Postconditions (Success)**: Password reset email sent (token created)
 256: - **Main Flow**:
 257:   1. User enters email.
 258:   2. API generates reset token.
 259:   3. API stores token.
 260:   4. API sends reset email.
 261: - **Related Systems**: Email Service
 262: - **Related API**: `/api/auth` (forgot/reset)
