 477: ## 3) Data Flow Diagram (DFD)
 478: 
 479: ### 3.1 DFD Level 0 (Context-level processes)
 480: 
 481: #### External entities
 482: 
 483: - **EE-01**: User (Guest/Authenticated)
 484: - **EE-02**: OAuth Provider (Google/GitHub)
 485: - **EE-03**: Email Service
 486: - **EE-04**: Stripe
 487: - **EE-05**: AI Provider
 488: - **EE-06**: AWS S3
 489: - **EE-07**: Conversion Service
 490: - **EE-08**: Redis Queue
 491: 
 492: #### Processes
 493: 
 494: - **P1**: Authenticate & Manage Sessions
 495: - **P2**: Workspace & Membership Management
 496: - **P3**: Paper Management (Upload/Access/Metadata)
 497: - **P4**: Collection Management (Membership, Add/Remove Papers)
 498: - **P5**: Processing + AI (Extract/Chunk/Summary/Insights)
 499: - **P6**: Billing & Subscription Management
 500: - **P7**: Collaboration (Discussions) + Activity Logging
 501: 
 502: #### Data stores (logical)
 503: 
 504: - **D1**: Users & Auth Data (`User`, `Account`, `Session`, tokens)
 505: - **D2**: Workspaces & Membership (`Workspace`, `WorkspaceMember`, `WorkspaceInvitation`)
 506: - **D3**: Papers & Files (`Paper`, `PaperFile`, `PaperChunk`)
 507: - **D4**: Collections (`Collection`, `CollectionMember`, `CollectionPaper`)
 508: - **D5**: AI Artifacts (`AISummary`, `AIInsightThread`, `AIInsightMessage`)
 509: - **D6**: Billing (`Subscription`, `Payment`, `Plan` + user stripe fields)
 510: - **D7**: Collaboration + Audit (`DiscussionThread`, `DiscussionMessage`, `ActivityLog*`)
 511: 
 512: #### Level 0 flows (use these arrow labels)
 513: 
 514: - User → P1: `credentials / oauth sign-in request`
 515: - P1 → D1: `user/session read-write`
 516: - P1 ↔ OAuth Provider: `oauth tokens + profile`
 517: - P1 ↔ Email Service: `verification/reset emails`
 518: 
 519: - User → P2: `workspace actions (create/update/invite/accept)`
 520: - P2 → D2: `workspace/membership read-write`
 521: - P2 ↔ Email Service: `workspace invitation email`
 522: 
 523: - User → P3: `paper upload + paper queries`
 524: - P3 → D3: `paper/file metadata read-write`
 525: - P3 ↔ AWS S3: `file upload/download/presign`
 526: - P3 → P5: `enqueue processing job`
 527: 
 528: - User → P4: `collection actions (create/invite/add paper)`
 529: - P4 → D4: `collection read-write`
 530: - P4 ↔ Email Service: `collection invitation email`
 531: - P4 ↔ D3: `read paper list / paper references`
 532: 
 533: - User → P5: `generate summary/insight request`
 534: - P5 ↔ AI Provider: `prompt + response`
