 904: ## 9) State Diagrams (Paper Lifecycle)
 905: 
 906: This state diagram models the `PaperProcessingStatus` and `isDraft`/`isPublished` flags.
 907: 
 908: ```mermaid
 909: stateDiagram-v2
 910:   state "Under Review" as UnderReview
 911: 
 912:   [*] --> Draft: Created in Editor
 913:   Draft --> Published: Publish Draft
 914: 
 915:   [*] --> Uploaded: File Upload (PDF/DOCX)
 916:   Uploaded --> Processing: Enqueue Job (Redis)
 917:   Processing --> Processed: Success (Chunks Created)
 918:   Processing --> Failed: Error (Retry logic)
 919:   Failed --> Processing: Retry
 920: 
 921:   Processed --> Flagged: Content Flagged
 922:   Flagged --> UnderReview: Admin Pickup
 923:   UnderReview --> Published: Approve
 924:   UnderReview --> Rejected: Reject
 925:   UnderReview --> Archived: Archive
 926: 
 927:   Published --> [*]
 928:   Rejected --> [*]
 929:   Archived --> [*]
 930: ```
